sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Lewis (2003) zebrafish her1/her7 autoinhibitory delay differential oscillator and DeltaC-Notch synchronization — MorphoEval overall 90.8/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 post-remediation evaluation of `2003-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator.py` (91.1/100, up from 58.9/100 in Pass 1; +32.2 overall). The remediated script integrates Lewis's (2003) autoinhibitory her1/her7 delay differential equations via a 4th-order Runge-Kutta method-of-steps solver, derives the exact characteristic-equation Hopf bifurcation threshold T_crit = 7.54 min around the fixed point (m* = 8.27, p* = 161.76 molecules), verifies total-delay invariance T_tot = T_m + T_p, reproduces all 5 experimental regimes across Lewis (2003), Giudicelli et al. (2007), and Herrgen et al. (2010) (WT T_osc = 30.01 min, pure her7 fast branch 24.65 min, pure her1 slow branch 36.65 min, Notch delay slowing 32.45 min, and intron-deletion/CHX arrest 0.0 min; Pearson r = 0.9999, RMSE = 0.174 min), models multicellular DeltaC-Notch phase synchronization (WT R_sync = 0.9840 vs bea/des/aei mutant preserving 6 anterior somites before dropping to R_sync = 0.2316), and segments the vendored vertebrate SEM specimen (`zebrafish_somites_specimen.jpg`, 8 upper and 9 lower somites, mean spacing 48.47 px), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_022_her1_her7_delayed_oscillator.lean`. Overall 90.8/100 (faithfulness 90.4, reproducibility 91.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 87, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 93, Code-to-model traceability 91, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator_comparison.png: rendered output of 2003-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1297780 B, 2352×1372 px, artifact_sha256 0e1ad609466f9bb60c1a445eb6803998bd157f8317975fa758496ed2cb2aa073 (sha256 0e1ad609466f9bb60c1a445eb6803998bd157f8317975fa758496ed2cb2aa073), spec_fingerprint aac320679fac08d48974a97790e40f0dc67f5f375d8c0e064bf33e9bb39965c7. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: aac320679fac08d48974a97790e40f0dc67f5f375d8c0e064bf33e9bb39965c7; artifact_sha256: 0e1ad609466f9bb60c1a445eb6803998bd157f8317975fa758496ed2cb2aa073; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator_reference.json=5c4993acb1c42c84..., datasets/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator/scout_manifest.json=ebe3f2cee38772dd..., datasets/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator/zebrafish_somites_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Lewis (2003) Current Biology 13:1398-1408 single-cell her1/her7 delay differential equations dp/dt = a m(t - T_p) - b p(t) and dm/dt = k / (1 + (p(t - T_m)/p_0)^n) - c m(t) | Supercritical Hopf bifurcation threshold T_tot = T_m + T_p > T_crit, oscillation period rule T_osc ~ 2*(T_m + T_p + tau_p + tau_m) ~ 30 min at 28 C, and DeltaC-Notch synchronization vs bea/des/aei mutant desynchronization after 5-7 anterior somites; reconstructed_in_script: 4th-order Runge-Kutta method-of-steps DDE integrator verifying total delay invariance (T_m - delta, T_p + delta), Hopf threshold T_crit = 7.54 min, subcritical intron-deletion damping (0 late peaks), and cycloheximide arrest (a=0 -> m*=143.5 molecules) | 32-cell stochastic PSM phase-oscillator ensemble reproducing wild-type Notch-coupled synchrony (R_sync = 0.9840, 14/14 intact somites) vs Notch mutant desynchronization after 6 intact anterior somites (late R_sync = 0.2316) | Bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak and inter-somitic cleft segmentation on zebrafish_somites_specimen.jpg (48.47 px mean spacing, symmetry ratio 0.9605); transfer_boundary: Single-cell her1/her7 DDE and 1D stochastic Kuramoto-Notch PSM chain mapped to dorsal vertebrate SEM somite metameres; does_not_claim: Full 2D spatial traveling kinematic phase waves with Doppler tailbud shortening or explicit Hes6 heterodimer stoichiometry." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the anterior-to-posterior spatial phase gradient to the Schröter et al. (2012) Her1/Her7/Hes6 heterodimerization truth table.",
            "remediation needed: Extend the 32-cell stochastic phase chain to a full 2D multicellular DDE lattice with explicit delayed DeltaC protein translation and Notch intracellular domain (NICD) cleavage kinetics." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.908"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary) + Claude Sonnet 5.5 High (independent second assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

